   :observed "In a new private owner fixture an approved apply worker was SIGKILLed at durable-intent. A separate real BB facade invocation carrying a valid preview request returned exit 4, action apply, status failed-restored and target_writes 10. The retained journal was changed to restored. Thus a preview triggered actual compensation writes rather than zero target/state writes; decoding and closed shape checking of nonempty request bytes also happens after those writes."
   :fixture "/tmp/opencode/oikos-review-preview-_lr5imzv"
   :causal-path "runner reads nonempty request bytes, then calls engine.recover unconditionally before wire.decode and before distinguishing preview/check from a mutating request; successful compensation returns immediately rather than processing that request."
   :contract-tension "The frozen plan also requires startup recovery before admission. Reconcile this explicitly without granting writes to preview/check or malformed request input: for example a distinct recovery-only invocation before retrying the read; do not silently weaken either contract."
   :required-regression "Real fixed facade, fresh process, valid incomplete capsule, both preview and check plus duplicate-key/malformed input: independently record native mutations and assert zero request-triggered writes; separately run owner-policy-only recovery and prove actual compensation, then retry the read and verify its normal result. Preserve no-original-plan recovery and fresh-process positive controls."}
  {:id "SGC-P2-2" :severity :p2
