   :locations ["scripts/local_generation_fs.py:485-509" "docs/local-generations-v1.md:386-388"]
   :observed "New private fixture first successfully applied generation a. Preview for b with deliberately wrong expected_generation returned denied/current-drift, target_writes 0, before null and after null, although current actually selected a. The denial occurs after _observe obtained that selection."
   :fixture "/tmp/opencode/oikos-review-result-simuhb4c"
